  m_Name: Text_BarnWorker_BarnTalk_Fool
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Careful fools are still fools. Three sacks a week, every week, for months, and never a forced lock? That's not a hungry man. A hungry man takes too much once and gets caught. This one takes just enough, like he's being paid for it.
